bp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></picture></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hero-search-wrapper _searchBand_d99120"><div class="container"><div class="hero-search-dropdown-wrap _searchDropdown_d99120"><div data-builder-node-key="search" style="display:contents"><label for="hero-search-ko" class="_searchLabel_d99120">어떻게 도와드릴까요?</label><form class="hero-search-bar _searchBar_d99120" action="/ko/search" method="get"><input id="hero-search-ko" class="search-input hero-search-input" type="search" name="q" placeholder="예: 회사 설립" aria-label="어떻게 도와드릴까요?"/><button class="hero-search-btn" type="submit" aria-label="검색"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg></button></form></div><a href="#insights" class="hero-scroll-arrow _scrollArrow_d99120" aria-label="아래로 스크롤"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6,10 14,18 22,10"></polyline></svg></a></div></div></div></section><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--light services-bento _servicesEditorial_d99120" id="practice" data-tone="light" data-presentation="editorial"><div class="container"><div class="section-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">SERVICES</div><h2 class="section-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline">주요 서비스</h2><p class="section-lede" data-builder-surface-key="description">대만 내 투자, 소송, 자문 전반을 구조화하여 제공합니다.</p><div class="ornament-divider" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ornament" viewBox="0 0 120 24" role="presentation" focusable="false"><line x1="0" y1="12" x2="40" y2="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></line><circle cx="60" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle><line x1="80" y1="12" x2="120" y2="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></line></svg></div><div class="services-detail-list services-card-grid"><div class="services-card-grid-item"><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="investment"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="0"><path d="M5 19V7.5h14V19" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5 10.5h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 7.5V5.5h6V7.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 13.5v3M12 13.5v3M16 13.5v3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M4 19h16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">투자·법인설립</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">한국 기업의 대만 진출을 위한 법인 형태 선택(자회사·지사·유한회사)부터 투자심의위원회 승인, 자본금 송금, 은행 계좌 개설, 영업장소 확보까지 전 과정을 지원합니다. 화장품·물류 등 업종별 인허가 요건과 해산·청산을 통한 자본금 회수 절차까지 안내합니다.</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="투자·법인설립: 자세히 보기" href="/ko/services/investment">자세히 보기 →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><span id="real-estate" class="services-anchor-alias" aria-hidden="true"></span><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="civil"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="1"><path d="M7 4.5h7.2L17 7.3V19.5H7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.2 4.5v2.8H17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.5 11h5M9.5 14h3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.2 16.8h2.6M15.8 15.4l1.4 1.4-1.4 1.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">민사소송·손해배상</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">계약 분쟁, 손해배상, 소비자 피해 등 민사 사건 전반을 대응합니다. 한국 유학생 헬스장 부상 사건에서 1심 157만 대만달러 손해배상 판결을 이끌어낸 실적이 있으며, 한국어로 한국 의뢰인을 밀착 지원하고 외국인 의뢰인의 대만 소송 절차는 사무소 상담 언어(한국어·중국어·일본어·영어)로 지원합니다.</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="민사소송·손해배상: 자세히 보기" href="/ko/services/civil">자세히 보기 →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="family"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="2"><path d="M4.5 6.5v11h5.2V6.5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.3 6.5v11h5.2V6.5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.7 9.5H14.3M9.7 14.5H14.3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8.2 12h1M14.8 12h1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">가사소송</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">이혼, 재산분할, 친권, 상속 등 가사 사건을 대응합니다. 한국-대만 국제결혼 증가에 따른 협의이혼·조정이혼 절차, 외국인 배우자의 호적 등록 문제, 상속 순위 및 잔여재산 분배 청구까지 전략적으로 지원합니다.</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="가사소송: 자세히 보기" href="/ko/services/family">자세히 보기 →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="labor"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="3"><path d="M4.5 7h6.2v10H4.5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M13.3 7h6.2v10H13.3z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.2 10h2.8M15 10h2.8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.2 13.5h2.8M15 13.5h2.8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">노동법·고용분쟁</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">대만의 해고, 퇴직금(資遣費), 근로계약 분쟁을 다룹니다. 계약 종료의 법적 근거와 예고·퇴직금·기한을 구분하고, 신제·구제 근속기간별 산정, 근로자 측 계약 종료의 법정 사유, 최소 근무기간 약정의 법정 요건과 합리성, 비용 반환 및 책임 귀속을 구체적인 계약과 증거에 따라 검토합니다.</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="노동법·고용분쟁: 자세히 보기" href="/ko/services/labor">자세히 보기 →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="criminal"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="4"><path d="M4 8.2h16M4 12h4.2M15.8 12H20M4 15.8h16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 8.8l3.2 3.2L12 15.2 8.8 12z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">형사소송</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">대만 형사 절차에서의 수사 대응, 피의자·피해자 대리, 변호인 접견을 수행합니다. 규제 위반에 따른 형사 처벌 리스크(자본금 불법 인출 시 최대 5년 이하 징역, 업종 무허가 영업 등) 사전 점검과 방어 전략을 제공합니다.</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="형사소송: 자세히 보기" href="/ko/services/criminal">자세히 보기 →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><span id="finance" class="services-anchor-alias" aria-hidden="true"></span><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="ip"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="5"><path d="M7 7h.01M12 7h.01M17 7h.01M7 12h.01M12 12h.01M17 12h.01M7 17h.01M12 17h.01M17 17h.01" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M7 7h10M7 12h10M7 17h10M7 7v10M12 7v10M17 7v10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">지적재산·금융분쟁</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">상표·특허·저작권 등 지적재산 보호와 금융·투자 관련 분쟁을 대응합니다. 대만 진출 시 상표 선등록 확인, 브랜드 보호 전략, 금융상품·투자계약 분쟁의 사실관계 분석 및 소송을 지원합니다.</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="지적재산·금융분쟁: 자세히 보기" href="/ko/services/ip">자세히 보기 →</a></div></article></div></div></div></section></div><div class="taiwan-heritage-interlude" data-home-heritage-interlude="true"><div class="decorative-autoplay-video taiwan-heritage-interlude__media" data-video-mounted="false" data-video-ready="false"><picture><source media="(max-width: 640px)" srcSet="/images/editorial/taiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2-mobile.webp" type="image/webp"/><img alt="밝은 대만 전통 산허위안과 현대식 파빌리온이 어우러진 풍경" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="decorative-autoplay-video__poster taiwan-heritage-interlude__poster" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></picture></div></div><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--gray split-section split--img-left" id="about" data-tone="light"><div class="split-image split-image--portrait" data-builder-node-key="media" data-home-stock-portrait="true"><img alt="증준외 대표 변호사" data-builder-surface-key="lead-photo" loading="lazy" width="773" height="865" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="person-photo" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="split-portrait-badge"><strong>증준외</strong><span>대표 변호사</span></div></div><div class="split-content" data-builder-node-key="copy"><div class="section-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">ABOUT</div><h2 class="split-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline">증준외 변호사, 한국 고객을 위한 대만 법률 파트너</h2><div class="split-divider"></div><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="intro-primary">기업·개인 사건을 폭넓게 수행합니다. 당사무소에서는 한국어·중국어·일본어·영어로 상담하실 수 있습니다.</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="intro-secondary">한국 유학생 헬스장 손해배상 사건에서 1심 157만 대만달러 배상 판결을 이끈 사례가 있습니다.</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="summary">법원 소송 실무와 기업 법률고문 경험을 바탕으로, SBS 뉴스에 법률 의견과 해설을 제공하고 WEI Lawyer를 통해 법률정보를 꾸준히 발행하고 있습니다.</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="contact-line">증준외 · 대표 변호사 · wei@hoveringlaw.com.tw</p><a class="link-underline" href="/ko/lawyers/wei-tseng">변호사 프로필 보기 →</a></div></section></div><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--dark split-section split--img-left home-results-panel home-results-panel--editorial" id="results" data-tone="dark"><div class="split-image home-results-media" data-builder-node-key="media"><span class="home-results-media-fallback" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="decorative-autoplay-video home-results-media-player" data-video-mounted="false" data-video-ready="false"><picture><source media="(max-width: 640px)" srcSet="/images/editorial/taiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2-mobile.webp" type="image/webp"/><img alt="밝고 비어 있는 현대식 대만 민사 법정" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="decorative-autoplay-video__poster home-results-media-img" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 52vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></picture></div></div><div class="split-content home-results-content" data-builder-node-key="copy"><div class="section-label home-results-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">사례 분석</div><h2 class="split-title home-results-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline"><span>한국 유학생 헬스장 부상 사건<br/></span><span>1심 157만 TWD 판결·항소심 화해<br/></span></h2><div class="split-divider"></div><p class="split-text home-results-text" data-builder-surface-key="case-description">대만 헬스장에서 트레이너의 지도를 받아 운동하던 중 다친 한국인 대학생이 손해배상을 청구한 사건입니다. 1심에서 157만 TWD의 배상을 인정하는 판결이 내려졌고, 이후 항소심에서 당사자 간 화해로 종결되었습니다.</p><p class="split-text home-results-text" data-builder-surface-key="case-summary">사건 결과는 구체적인 사실관계와 증거에 따라 달라질 수 있으며, 이 사례는 과거 한 사건의 진행 경과를 소개합니다.</p><a class="link-underline home-results-link" href="/ko/columns">소송사례 분석 보기 →</a></div></section></div><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--light stats-section" id="stats" data-tone="light"><div class="container"><div class="section-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">ABOUT</div><h2 class="section-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline">공식 프로필로 확인하는 국제 업무 기반</h2><p class="scroll-highlight section-lede" data-builder-surface-key="description"><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:0ms">당사무소는</span><span> </span><span class="scroll-highlight-word is-keyword" style="transition-delay:24ms">한국어</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:48ms">·</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word is-keyword" style="transition-delay:72ms">중국어</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:96ms">·</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word is-keyword" style="transition-delay:120ms">일본어</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:144ms">·</span><span class="scroll-highlight-wo