640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="split-portrait-badge"><strong>曾雋崴</strong><span>代表律師</span></div></div><div class="split-content" data-builder-node-key="copy"><div class="section-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">ABOUT</div><h2 class="split-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline">曾雋崴律師，在地與跨境客戶的台灣法律夥伴</h2><div class="split-divider"></div><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="intro-primary">專精企業與個人案件。事務所可提供韓文、中文、日文、英文法律溝通。</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="intro-secondary">曾代理韓國留學生健身傷害求償案，於一審獲判新台幣 157 萬元。</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="summary">具備法院訴訟實務與企業法律顧問經驗，曾為 SBS 新聞提供法律意見與解說，並持續透過 WEI Lawyer 發布法律資訊。</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="contact-line">曾雋崴 · 代表律師 · wei@hoveringlaw.com.tw</p><a class="link-underline" href="/zh-hant/lawyers/wei-tseng">查看律師簡介 →</a></div></section></div><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--dark split-section split--img-left home-results-panel home-results-panel--editorial" id="results" data-tone="dark"><div class="split-image home-results-media" data-builder-node-key="media"><span class="home-results-media-fallback" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="decorative-autoplay-video home-results-media-player" data-video-mounted="false" data-video-ready="false"><picture><source media="(max-width: 640px)" srcSet="/images/editorial/taiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2-mobile.webp" type="image/webp"/><img alt="明亮空曠的現代臺灣民事法庭" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="decorative-autoplay-video__poster home-results-media-img" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 52vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></picture></div></div><div class="split-content home-results-content" data-builder-node-key="copy"><div class="section-label home-results-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">案例解析</div><h2 class="split-title home-results-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline"><span>韓國留學生健身房受傷案<br/></span><span>一審判賠157萬TWD，二審和解<br/></span></h2><div class="split-divider"></div><p class="split-text home-results-text" data-builder-surface-key="case-description">韓國大學生在台灣健身房接受教練指導運動時受傷，因而提起損害賠償請求。一審判決賠償157萬TWD，其後於二審由雙方和解結案。</p><p class="split-text home-results-text" data-builder-surface-key="case-summary">案件結果會因具體事實與證據而異；本案例僅說明一件過往案件的處理經過。</p><a class="link-underline home-results-link" href="/zh-hant/columns">查看訴訟案例 →</a></div></section></div><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--light stats-section" id="stats" data-tone="light"><div class="container"><div class="section-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">ABOUT</div><h2 class="section-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline">從官方資料看跨境服務基礎</h2><p class="scroll-highlight section-lede" data-builder-surface-key="description"><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:0ms">事</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:24ms">務</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:48ms">所</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:72ms">提</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:96ms">供</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word is-keyword" style="transition-delay:120ms">中文</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:144ms">／</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word is-keyword" style="transition-delay:168ms">韓文</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:192ms">／</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word is-keyword" style="transition-delay:216ms">日文</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:240ms">／</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word is-keyword" style="transition-delay:264ms">英文</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:288ms">4</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:312ms">種</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:336ms">語</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:360ms">言</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:360ms">的</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:360ms">台</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:360ms">灣</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-d