ideo__poster hero-media-image" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaichung-courthouse-civic-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></picture></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hero-search-wrapper _searchBand_d99120"><div class="container"><div class="hero-search-dropdown-wrap _searchDropdown_d99120"><div data-builder-node-key="search" style="display:contents"><label for="hero-search-ja" class="_searchLabel_d99120">どのようにお手伝いできますか？</label><form class="hero-search-bar _searchBar_d99120" action="/ja/search" method="get"><input id="hero-search-ja" class="search-input hero-search-input" type="search" name="q" placeholder="例：会社設立" aria-label="どのようにお手伝いできますか？"/><button class="hero-search-btn" type="submit" aria-label="検索"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg></button></form></div><a href="#insights" class="hero-scroll-arrow _scrollArrow_d99120" aria-label="下へスクロール"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6,10 14,18 22,10"></polyline></svg></a></div></div></div></section><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--light services-bento _servicesEditorial_d99120" id="practice" data-tone="light" data-presentation="editorial"><div class="container"><div class="section-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">SERVICES</div><h2 class="section-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline">主要サービス</h2><p class="section-lede" data-builder-surface-key="description">台湾における投資、訴訟、法務顧問業務を総合的に支援します。</p><div class="ornament-divider" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ornament" viewBox="0 0 120 24" role="presentation" focusable="false"><line x1="0" y1="12" x2="40" y2="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></line><circle cx="60" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle><line x1="80" y1="12" x2="120" y2="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></line></svg></div><div class="services-detail-list services-card-grid"><div class="services-card-grid-item"><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="investment"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="0"><path d="M5 19V7.5h14V19" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5 10.5h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 7.5V5.5h6V7.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 13.5v3M12 13.5v3M16 13.5v3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M4 19h16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">投資・会社設立</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">日本企業をはじめ外国企業の台湾進出に際し、台湾子会社・台湾支店・代表者事務所等の組織形態の選定から、必要に応じた経済部投資審議司への投資申請、投資資金の送金・投資額審定、銀行口座の開設、営業場所の適法性確認まで一貫して支援します。化粧品の製品登録・PIF作成保存、自動車貨物運送業等の業種別許認可、解散・清算等による残余財産・投資資金回収の法的手続についてもご案内します。</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="投資・会社設立: 詳しく見る" href="/ja/services/investment">詳しく見る →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><span id="real-estate" class="services-anchor-alias" aria-hidden="true"></span><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="civil"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="1"><path d="M7 4.5h7.2L17 7.3V19.5H7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.2 4.5v2.8H17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.5 11h5M9.5 14h3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.2 16.8h2.6M15.8 15.4l1.4 1.4-1.4 1.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">民事訴訟・損害賠償</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">契約紛争、損害賠償、消費者被害など、民事事件全般に対応します。韓国人留学生のジム負傷事件では、一審で157万新台湾ドルの損害賠償を認める判決を得た実績があり、外国人依頼者による台湾での訴訟手続を日本語で一貫して支援します。</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="民事訴訟・損害賠償: 詳しく見る" href="/ja/services/civil">詳しく見る →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="family"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="2"><path d="M4.5 6.5v11h5.2V6.5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.3 6.5v11h5.2V6.5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.7 9.5H14.3M9.7 14.5H14.3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8.2 12h1M14.8 12h1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">家事事件</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">離婚、財産分与、親権、相続などの家事事件に対応します。台湾を含む国際結婚に伴う協議離婚・調停離婚・裁判離婚の手続、外国人配偶者に関する戸政手続、法定相続順位および残余財産差額分配請求について、戦略的に支援します。</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="家事事件: 詳しく見る" href="/ja/services/family">詳しく見る →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="labor"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="3"><path d="M4.5 7h6.2v10H4.5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M13.3 7h6.2v10H13.3z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.2 10h2.8M15 10h2.8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.2 13.5h2.8M15 13.5h2.8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">労働・雇用</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">台湾法上の解雇、退職金（資遣費）、労働契約をめぐる紛争に対応します。退職金（資遣費）の算定（新制では勤続1年につき平均賃金0.5か月分、上限6か月分）、雇用主の違法行為等を理由に労働者側から契約を終了した場合の請求可否、最低勤務期間条項の有効性について、実務に即して助言します。</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="労働・雇用: 詳しく見る" href="/ja/services/labor">詳しく見る →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="criminal"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="4"><path d="M4 8.2h16M4 12h4.2M15.8 12H20M4 15.8h16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 8.8l3.2 3.2L12 15.2 8.8 12z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">刑事事件</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">台湾の刑事手続における捜査対応、被疑者・被告人の弁護、被害者代理、弁護人接見に対応します。資本金の不正な払戻しや無許可営業など、法令・規制違反に伴う刑事責任を事前に検討し、防御方針を策定します。</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="刑事事件: 詳しく見る" href="/ja/services/criminal">詳しく見る →</a></div></article></div><div class="services-card-grid-item"><span id="finance" class="services-anchor-alias" aria-hidden="true"></span><article class="services-detail-card services-card" id="ip"><div class="services-detail-header services-card-header"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="service-practice-icon" data-practice-icon="5"><path d="M7 7h.01M12 7h.01M17 7h.01M7 12h.01M12 12h.01M17 12h.01M7 17h.01M12 17h.01M17 17h.01" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M7 7h10M7 12h10M7 17h10M7 7v10M12 7v10M17 7v10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h3 class="services-detail-title">知財・金融紛争</h3></div><div class="services-detail-body services-card-body"><p class="services-detail-desc services-card-summary">商標・特許・著作権などの知的財産権の保護と、金融・投資関連の紛争に対応します。台湾進出時の先行商標調査、ブランド保護戦略の策定、金融商品・投資契約に関する紛争の事実関係分析および訴訟を支援します。</p><a class="services-detail-more services-card-link" aria-label="知財・金融紛争: 詳しく見る" href="/ja/services/ip">詳しく見る →</a></div></article></div></div><p><a class="link-underline" href="/ja/taiwan-lawyer#corporate-advisory">台湾の企業法務・法律顧問</a> — 海外企業が台湾に進出・運営する際の契約確認、取引上の法的リスク、労務・雇用に関するご相談です。</p></div></section></div><div class="taiwan-heritage-interlude" data-home-heritage-interlude="true"><div class="decorative-autoplay-video taiwan-heritage-interlude__media" data-video-mounted="false" data-video-ready="false"><picture><source media="(max-width: 640px)" srcSet="/images/editorial/taiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2-mobile.webp" type="image/webp"/><img alt="明るい台湾の伝統的な三合院と現代的なパビリオン" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="decorative-autoplay-video__poster taiwan-heritage-interlude__poster" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-sanheyuan-modern-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></picture></div></div><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--gray split-section split--img-left" id="about" data-tone="light"><div class="split-image split-image--portrait" data-builder-node-key="media" data-home-stock-portrait="true"><img alt="曾雋崴弁護士 台湾弁護士・代表弁護士" data-builder-surface-key="lead-photo" loading="lazy" width="773" height="865" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="person-photo" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Ftseng-junwei.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="split-portrait-badge"><strong>曾雋崴弁護士</strong><span>台湾弁護士・代表弁護士</span></div></div><div class="split-content" data-builder-node-key="copy"><div class="section-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">ABOUT</div><h2 class="split-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline">曾雋崴弁護士 — 日本語で<span style="white-space:nowrap">相談</span>できる台湾法務パートナー</h2><div class="split-divider"></div><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="intro-primary">企業・個人の幅広い案件を担当しています。当事務所では日本語・英語・韓国語・中国語でご相談いただけます。</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="intro-secondary">韓国人留学生のジムでの負傷に関する損害賠償請求事件を代理し、一審で157万TWDの損害賠償を認める判決を得た実績があります。</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="summary">裁判所での訴訟実務と企業の法律顧問としての経験を有し、SBSニュースに法律上の意見・解説を提供するとともに、WEI Lawyerを通じて法律情報を継続的に発信しています。</p><p class="split-text" data-builder-surface-key="contact-line">曾雋崴弁護士 · 台湾弁護士・代表弁護士 · wei@hoveringlaw.com.tw</p><a class="link-underline" href="/ja/lawyers/wei-tseng">弁護士プロフィールを見る →</a></div></section></div><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--dark split-section split--img-left home-results-panel home-results-panel--editorial" id="results" data-tone="dark"><div class="split-image home-results-media" data-builder-node-key="media"><span class="home-results-media-fallback" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="decorative-autoplay-video home-results-media-player" data-video-mounted="false" data-video-ready="false"><picture><source media="(max-width: 640px)" srcSet="/images/editorial/taiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2-mobile.webp" type="image/webp"/><img alt="明るく無人の現代的な台湾民事法廷" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="decorative-autoplay-video__poster home-results-media-img" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 52vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Feditorial%2Ftaiwan-courtroom-calm-daylight-v2.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></picture></div></div><div class="split-content home-results-content" data-builder-node-key="copy"><div class="section-label home-results-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">事例紹介</div><h2 class="split-title home-results-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline"><span>韓国人留学生のジム負傷事件<br/></span><span>一審157万TWD判決後、<span style="white-space:nowrap">控訴審</span>で<span style="white-space:nowrap">和解</span><br/></span></h2><div class="split-divider"></div><p class="split-text home-results-text" data-builder-surface-key="case-description">台湾のジムでトレーナーの指導を受けて運動中に負傷した韓国人大学生が、損害賠償を請求した事例です。一審では157万TWDの損害賠償を認める判決が出され、その後、控訴審で当事者間の和解により終結しました。</p><p class="split-text home-results-text" data-builder-surface-key="case-summary">結果は具体的な事実関係や証拠により異なります。本事例は、過去の一案件の経過を紹介するものです。</p><a class="link-underline home-results-link" href="/ja/columns">取扱事例を見る →</a></div></section></div><div class="reveal"><section class="section section--light stats-section" id="stats" data-tone="light"><div class="container"><div class="section-label" data-builder-surface-key="section-label">ABOUT</div><h2 class="section-title" data-builder-surface-key="headline">公式プロフィールで見る国際業務の基盤</h2><p class="scroll-highlight section-lede" data-builder-surface-key="description"><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:0ms">当</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:24ms">事</span><span class="scroll-highlight-word" style="transition-delay:48ms">務</span><span class="scroll-highligh